{"description": "![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16503982/117508563-6d3dab00-af4e-11eb-96d5-4f73694781d7.png)\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16503982/117508599-7e86b780-af4e-11eb-8097-8d93a5620776.png)\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16503982/117508712-aaa23880-af4e-11eb-8120-a0051ed221ec.png)\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16503982/117508660-9827ff00-af4e-11eb-846d-678e0f2760fe.png)\r\n", "comments": [{"id": 629346056, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-10T13:11:33Z", "body": "Could this use the [`SwipeToDismiss` composable](https://cs.android.com/androidx/platform/frameworks/support/+/androidx-main:compose/material/material/src/commonMain/kotlin/androidx/compose/material/SwipeToDismiss.kt;l=172)?"}, {"id": 630018673, "in_reply_to_id": 629346056, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-11T09:48:21Z", "body": "Thanks\u2014feels cleaner!"}, {"id": 630019217, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-11T09:49:02Z", "body": "These 'thresholds' seem to be in pixel values? Should they be defined in `dp`s then converted to pixels?"}, {"id": 630019413, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-11T09:49:18Z", "body": "Please can you add some comments for each branch"}, {"id": 630019769, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-11T09:49:48Z", "body": "Is `Row` needed? Seems like content is always centered, not arranged horizontally?"}, {"id": 630020525, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-11T09:50:54Z", "body": "Looks like this is setting a specific height? `requiredHeight(120.dp)` might read better?"}, {"id": 630020830, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-11T09:51:21Z", "body": "Again, comments please."}, {"id": 630021991, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-11T09:52:59Z", "body": "Rather than changing the layout size, could we use a `graphicsLayer` modifier to scale the item as this will only require re-draw, no re-layout."}, {"id": 630022984, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-11T09:54:24Z", "body": "Again, use `Modifier.alpha` (which uses `Modifier.graphicsLayer`) on the `Icon` to change the color and only require re-draw."}, {"id": 630023708, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-11T09:55:25Z", "body": "16*18 seems\u2026 strange? Won't this squish the icon?"}, {"id": 630023929, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-11T09:55:44Z", "body": "Again, `Modifier.alpha` here."}, {"id": 630024875, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/SwipeDismissItem.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-11T09:57:09Z", "body": "Comment"}, {"id": 630026002, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-11T09:58:48Z", "body": "Is this needed if `SwipeDismissItem` opts-in?"}, {"id": 630196685, "in_reply_to_id": 630019769, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-05-11T14:01:40Z", "body": "The `Row` is there to keep everything aligned to the right, also it controls the padding for the delete icon."}, {"id": 631814006, "in_reply_to_id": 630019217, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-05-13T13:34:57Z", "body": "Changed,"}, {"id": 631814711, "in_reply_to_id": 630023708, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-05-13T13:35:57Z", "body": "Took the values from the design, but I just changed it"}, {"id": 633422109, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-17T10:39:47Z", "body": "nit: The empty content block seems strange. We _could_ switch to a `Box` with a `.background` modifier?"}, {"id": 633422334, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-17T10:40:12Z", "body": "nit: Use `.size(16.dp)`"}, {"id": 633422959, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-17T10:41:19Z", "body": "`.fillMaxSize`"}, {"id": 633423152, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-05-17T10:41:37Z", "body": "Trailing lambda."}, {"id": 633711315, "in_reply_to_id": 633422109, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-05-17T17:12:00Z", "body": "The Box component doesn't resize by modifying its graphics layer that is why I used the surface, do you have another suggestion?"}, {"id": 642927865, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "chrisbanes", "created_at": "2021-06-01T09:14:35Z", "body": "200.dp seems a bit arbitrary? Is this a computed value? "}, {"id": 642928140, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "chrisbanes", "created_at": "2021-06-01T09:14:56Z", "body": "These values should align to a 8.dp grid"}, {"id": 642928550, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "chrisbanes", "created_at": "2021-06-01T09:15:29Z", "body": "Again, seems like an arbitrary value"}, {"id": 642929830, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "chrisbanes", "created_at": "2021-06-01T09:17:19Z", "body": "Doesn't look like this Row is needed? It only seems to have 1 child"}, {"id": 642931196, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "chrisbanes", "created_at": "2021-06-01T09:19:11Z", "body": "All of the Rows in this Box have only 1 child. Do we need 3 of them?"}, {"id": 653909377, "in_reply_to_id": 642931196, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-06-17T20:23:59Z", "body": "New implementation doesn't has Rows within SwipeDismissItem composable"}, {"id": 653909732, "in_reply_to_id": 642928550, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-06-17T20:24:39Z", "body": "Removed the hardcoded value, height depends on offset now"}, {"id": 653910135, "in_reply_to_id": 642928140, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-06-17T20:25:13Z", "body": "Padding right no longer exist, but kept other values align with 8.dp grid"}, {"id": 653913901, "in_reply_to_id": 642927865, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-06-17T20:31:21Z", "body": "This value is no longer used, however I do have some values for changing the behavior from a circular red shape to a full red background, do you have another suggestion on how to make this change instead of using fixed offset breakpoints?"}, {"id": 653913989, "in_reply_to_id": 642929830, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-06-17T20:31:32Z", "body": "I removed the Row"}, {"id": 669606629, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-07-14T13:18:16Z", "body": "Does this cause a jump? Wrap in `animateDpAsState`?"}, {"id": 669607919, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-07-14T13:19:49Z", "body": "Shold this `lerp` rather than switch abruptly?"}, {"id": 669609998, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "nickbutcher", "created_at": "2021-07-14T13:22:16Z", "body": "If we do continously change the alpha per the `lerp` comment, then we should switch this to the `graphicsLayer` overload which accept a lambda in `GraphicsLayerScope`: https://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/compose/ui/graphics/package-summary?db=androidx-refdocs#(androidx.compose.ui.Modifier).graphicsLayer(kotlin.Function1)\r\n\r\ni.e. the version that will only re-draw on changes."}, {"id": 673977911, "in_reply_to_id": 669606629, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-07-21T13:35:24Z", "body": "Done"}, {"id": 673978013, "in_reply_to_id": 669607919, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-07-21T13:35:31Z", "body": "Done"}, {"id": 673978079, "in_reply_to_id": 669609998, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-07-21T13:35:36Z", "body": "Done"}, {"id": 694774989, "in_reply_to_id": 633423152, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "JoseAlcerreca", "created_at": "2021-08-24T11:48:17Z", "body": "Move the content parameter in SwipeDismissItem to the end so that content can be expressed with a trailing lambda (as \"content\" is implicit) in that pattern."}, {"id": 694777333, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "JoseAlcerreca", "created_at": "2021-08-24T11:51:52Z", "body": "Please fix all long lines https://developer.android.com/kotlin/style-guide"}, {"id": 695143772, "in_reply_to_id": 630019413, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-08-24T19:33:03Z", "body": "I have already added the requested comments"}, {"id": 695144454, "in_reply_to_id": 630020525, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-08-24T19:34:07Z", "body": "This no longer applies, I changed the structure in a later commit"}, {"id": 695144536, "in_reply_to_id": 630020830, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/example/jetsnack/ui/home/cart/Cart.kt", "user": "angeles-bilbao6", "created_at": "2021-08-24T19:34:16Z", "body": "Done"}, {"id": 699216583, "in_reply_to_id": 633422109, "path": "Jetsnack/app/src/main/java/com/